  }, " 3. Arithmetic Drift or Reasoning Drift / Misleading Rationale(Common in Across All Caps):"), "\nThe models tend to produce correct multi-step reasoning structures\nbut arrive at wrong intermediate arithmetic values.\nThe JSON files show this pattern even at high caps (512\u2013768 tokens):"), mdx("ul", null, mdx("li", {
